<div class="world-section page-fill">
    <div class="world-container">
        @{
            // The places I've lived, in order. Edit the descriptions to tell each chapter.
            // labelSide is where the city name sits next to its pin, so nearby cities don't overlap.
            // wiki is the Wikipedia page the popup photo comes from,
