        @* PLACES THAT SHAPED ME *@
        <p class="world-eyebrow first">Where I came from</p>
        <h2 class="world-block-title" id="places">Places That Shaped Me</h2>
        <p class="world-block-subtitle">a little map of how I became me</p>
        <div class="map-layout">
            <div id="map"></div>
            <aside class="place-panel" aria-label="About the place you picked">
                <div class="place-panel-inner" id="placePanel" aria-live="polite">
                    <div class="place-panel-empty">
                        <h3 class="place-sub">Always the new kid</h3>
                        <p class="place-intro">My childhood was split across three countries, two continents, and ten schools, so I got very used to being the new person. I learned how to walk into a room where I knew absolutely no one, talk to pretty much anyone, make friends from scratch, and figure out a new environment quickly.</p>
                        <h3 class="place-sub">What it gave me</h3>
                        <p class="place-intro">Moving so much made me independent, adaptable, socially confident, and very comfortable with change. It also exposed me to people who grew up completely differently from me, which is where a lot of my curiosity about people, culture, and why we behave the way we do comes from.</p>
                        <p class="place-hint">Click a place to read about it ♡</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>

        @* PIECES OF ME *@
        @{
